World Magnetic Model 2025
-------------------------
Geodesy/WMM2025 includes the WMM2025 coefficient set and a Modelica
implementation of its spherical-harmonic evaluation. The model is produced
jointly by NOAA National Centers for Environmental Information (NCEI) and
the British Geological Survey (BGS). The WMM software and coefficients are
in the public domain in the United States. NOAA and BGS do not endorse
this port.
https://www.ncei.noaa.gov/products/world-magnetic-model

